OL,3,GNEWSADate set for maternity services to
OL,4,Areopen
OL,5,
OL,6,FA provisional date has been set to
OL,7,Freopen a maternity unit which closed
OL,8,Ftemporarily due to staffing shortages,
OL,9,Fan NHS trust has announced.
OL,11,FBirthing services at North Devon
OL,12,FDistrict Hospital in Barnstaple were
OL,13,Fdue to reopen on Tuesday 29 September,
OL,14,Fthe Royal Devon University Healthcare
OL,15,FNHS Foundation Trust said.
OL,17,FBosses said they had had made "positive
OL,18,Fprogress" to recruit medical staff
OL,19,Fneeded to reopen after it was shut in
OL,20,FAugust. The closure meant pregnant
OL,21,Fwomen had to travel 53 miles (85km)
OL,22,Faway to give birth in Exeter.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
