OL,3,GNEWSADate set for maternity services to
OL,4,Areopen
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe trust said it would make a formal
OL,7,Fdecision on 14 September after a final
OL,8,Freview to check staffing, skills needed
OL,9,Fand complying with safety criteria.
